This repository, Saveroom, is a fork of Baserow with the premium and enterprise editions
removed. Upstream Baserow is open-core: the "premium/" and "enterprise/"
directories were covered by separate proprietary licenses that required a paid
subscription for production use. Those directories are not part of this fork,
and no code from them remains here.

